rows.en:
Heh heh heh...
You know, you're rather popular.
People say there's a cute girl among the newspaper club's first-years...{p}

Oh, you don't?
How surprising.
To think a girl this cute has no sweetheart...{p}

His name was Yuya Igarashi.
Handsome, intelligent, composed...
He was like a prince straight out of a fairy tale.{p}

"I'll come back in three years.
To take you as my bride..."
With those words, he got into the car.{p}

Unable to bear the shock of his death, I finally took to my bed.
A high fever went on for days.
What came to my fever-tormented mind was a dream of Yuya.{p}

...I don't know how long I slept.
Perhaps I was still inside the dream...
A dusky gloom had spread around me, neither dream nor reality.{p}

Heh heh heh...
My, {a}, your eyes have gone so wide...
...So you can't believe it after all?{p}
